/*
 * Declares the LambdaContext class, which tracks semantic-validation state
 * related to lambda expressions and implicit lambda generation.
 *
 * This context is used to class which synthetic `lambda` symbols have been
 * generated to cast a function pointer `fn(...) -> T` into a delegate `dg(...)
 * -> T`. These implicit lambdas must be tracked to avoid generating duplicates
 * and to ensure consistent behavior across the semantic pass.
 *
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::context::lambda
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/context/lambda.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created (YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-03-18
